            'I track technical metrics, latency and errors, and prediction quality as soon as ground truth arrives. I monitor input data drift by comparing distributions with training data. Thresholds trigger alerts and a dashboard makes the state visible. Retraining uses recent data with offline validation, then a gradual rollout and model versioning.',
