        'en' => ['You discover a screening model disadvantages a group of candidates. What do you do?', 'Measure, alert, causes, fix, governance.',
            ['Measuring bias|measure,rate,group,fairness,metric,compare', 'Alerting|alert,manager,suspend,leadership,compliance', 'Analysing causes|historical data,features,proxy,sample,cause', 'Fixing and governance|fix,remove,rebalance,human review,documentation,audit'],
            ['Leaving the model live while investigating', 'Assuming the model is neutral because it is automated'],
            'I measure the gap by comparing selection and error rates by group on a representative sample. I alert my manager and compliance immediately and recommend suspending automated use. I analyse causes: biased historical data or features acting as a proxy for a protected characteristic. We fix the data and features, add human review and document fairness tests for future audits.',
            'measure,alert,historical data,human review'],
