            'I turn the notebook into tested modules and version code, data and parameters so training is reproducible. An orchestrated pipeline trains, evaluates and stores the model in a registry with its metrics. I serve it through a containerised API or a batch job as needed, deployed by CI. I add validation tests, logs and production metric tracking.',
