            'I analyse the text to identify the obligations that apply to us. With business teams I compare current practice with the requirements to list gaps. I build an action plan with owners, deadlines and risk based priorities, approved by management. I update procedures, train the teams concerned and plan controls to check application once the rule is in force.',
            'obligations,gaps,action plan,control'],
