            ['Only reporting to donors', 'Hiding delays in reports'],
            'I rely on a logframe with clear indicators and a monitoring plan. Teams collect data and I check quality through field visits. Donor reports present results, budget execution and variances with explanations. For communities, we set up accessible complaint and feedback mechanisms and report back what changed thanks to their input.',
            'indicators,monitoring,report,complaint'],
    ],
    ['code' => 'hum-motivation', 'prof' => 'humanitarian-coordinator', 'type' => 'motivation', 'lvl' => [2, 5], 'diff' => 3, 'sec' => 180, 'skills' => ['motivation_fit', 'multicultural'],
        'fr' => ['Pourquoi voulez-vous travailler dans l\'humanitaire, et comment gérez-vous la pression de ce métier sur la durée ?', 'Motivation, principes, expérience, équilibre.',
            ['Motivation sincère|motivation,utile,populations,engagement,sens', 'Principes humanitaires|humanite,neutralite,impartialite,independance,principes', 'Expérience concrète|experience,mission,terrain,j\'ai', 'Équilibre et durée|equilibre,repos,soutien,limites,collegues,psychologique'],
            ['Motivation centrée sur l\'aventure', 'Nier la charge émotionnelle'],
            'Je veux travailler là où mon organisation et ma rigueur ont un effet direct pour les populations touchées par les crises. J\'adhère aux principes d\'humanité, de neutralité, d\'impartialité et d\'indépendance. Lors d\'une mission de six mois dans un camp de déplacés, j\'ai coordonné des distributions pour 4 000 familles. Pour durer, je respecte les temps de repos, je m\'appuie sur l\'équipe et j\'utilise les dispositifs de soutien psychologique sans attendre d\'être épuisé.',
            'populations,principes,mission,equilibre'],
        'en' => ['Why do you want to work in humanitarian aid, and how do you sustain the pressure over time?', 'Motivation, principles, experience, balance.',
            ['Genuine motivation|motivation,useful,affected people,commitment,purpose', 'Humanitarian principles|humanity,neutrality,impartiality,independence,principles', 'Concrete experience|experience,mission,field', 'Balance over time|balance,rest,support,limits,colleagues,psychological'],
            ['Motivation centred on adventure', 'Denying the emotional load'],
            'I want to work where my organisation skills and rigour directly help people affected by crises. I subscribe to the principles of humanity, neutrality, impartiality and independence. During a six month mission in a displacement camp I coordinated distributions for 4,000 families. To last, I respect rest periods, rely on the team and use psychological support without waiting until I am exhausted.',
            'affected people,principles,mission,balance'],
    ],
